+# todo
+
+A small todo-list API. Go standard library only, todos kept in memory.
+
+## Run
+
+```bash
+go run ./cmd/todo                 # listens on :8081
+TODO_ADDR=:9000 go run ./cmd/todo # somewhere else
+go test ./...
+```
+
+## API
+
+| Method | Path | Body | Returns |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| `GET` | `/healthz` | | `ok` |
+| `GET` | `/todos` | | every todo |
+| `POST` | `/todos` | `{"title": "..."}` | the new todo, `201` |
+| `GET` | `/todos/{id}` | | one todo |
+| `PATCH` | `/todos/{id}` | `{"title": "...", "done": true}` | the updated todo |
+| `DELETE` | `/todos/{id}` | | `204` |
+
+Errors come back as `{"error": "..."}` with a 4xx status. Titles are required
+and at most 200 characters.
+
+```bash
+curl -s localhost:8081/todos -d '{"title": "buy milk"}'
+curl -s localhost:8081/todos
+curl -s -X PATCH localhost:8081/todos/1 -d '{"title": "buy milk", "done": true}'
+curl -s -X DELETE localhost:8081/todos/1
+```
+
+## Layout
+
+```
+cmd/todo/          main: config, wiring, graceful shutdown
+internal/todo/     the model, the in-memory store and the HTTP handlers
+internal/httpx/    middleware (request logging)
+```
